      "message": "[error] Line 997: 🔴 `retransmitNackPackets` processes every requested PID/BLP bit with no per-packet cap or deduplication. A single small Generic NACK can request a very large retransmission burst, creating amplification/self-DoS risk. Collect requested sequence numbers into a deduplicated set and enforce a strict maximum retransmits-per-RTCP-packet (drop/log excess).",
